


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_5017e90e:


    "撒豆子结束后——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_e8484c20:



    voice "2SA_0599"
    sachiko "「抗议！为什么只有我被集中攻击了！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_83cbe2ed:



    voice "2HI_0782"
    hina "「因为你是生剥鬼」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_a9d5e1c4:



    voice "2RI_0790"
    rin "「就是」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_e26cb56a:



    voice "2SA_0600"
    sachiko "「而且全都是『鬼在外』，完全没有『福在内』的部分啊？那个超攻击性撒豆是怎么回事？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_6d178d51:



    voice "2HI_0783"
    hina "「啊～那个实在是对不起。我扔得太专心了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_21fb900d:


    "叫喊着奇怪的声音追赶着鬼（祥子）的阳菜和伦的样子，简直宛如狂战士一般。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_09d9beee:



    voice "2SA_0601"
    sachiko "「明年我绝对不当鬼了啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_2bd6a23d:



    voice "2RI_0791"
    rin "「好了好了。空谈来年事，鬼都笑你痴。给你，福豆福豆」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_e6f18890:



    voice "2HI_0784"
    hina "「幸好还剩下了够吃的量，刚才实在是顺势撒过头了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_d814125a:



    voice "2FU_0639"
    fumi "「还好我们的房间里已经买好存着了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_c10152a1:


    "用去撒的豆是祥子准备的，四人买的豆还留着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_5a3e6b8c:



    voice "2RI_0792"
    rin "「虽然把撒掉的豆捡起来吃了才是原本的习俗，但吃掉在地上的东西还是有点不能接受呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_32180fd3:



    voice "2SA_0602"
    sachiko "「都怪你们兴奋地四处撒，现在宿舍里到处都是豆。之后打扫的可是我啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_99a1ecb7:



    voice "2HI_0785"
    hina "「明明是你自己说想过节分的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_282ce990:



    voice "2SA_0603"
    sachiko "「我可没说想要成为被人追杀的猎物！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_11a9453c:



    voice "2FU_0640"
    fumi "「啊哈哈，之后会帮忙打扫的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_280e10b1:



    voice "2RI_0793"
    rin "「来接好。帮你数好年龄数的豆子了哦。小阳菜是七颗哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_15a1398b:


    "伦把豆子放上手心，递给阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_764c0db0:



    voice "2HI_0786"
    hina "「这点完全不够吃！还有——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_d624baf6:



    voice "2SA_0604"
    sachiko "「我吃17个♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_c43479a0:



    voice "2RI_0794"
    rin "「别骗人了。快张开嘴，我直接用袋子往里面倒」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_059c7a7b:



    voice "2SA_0605"
    sachiko "「不——要——啊——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_94e58398:



    voice "2FU_0641"
    fumi "「圣夜子呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_e4d2514c:


    "吧唧吧唧吧唧吧唧……"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_1ece05fb:


    "圣夜子默默地不断将豆子送进嘴里。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_4775a0f6:



    voice "2FU_0642"
    fumi "「那、那个……圣夜子？豆子的数量是按你的年龄来的哟」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_1e482e7b:



    voice "2MI_0708"
    miyako "「唔唔唔唔唔唔」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b2ea6b1f:


    "嘴里塞满了豆子完全听不懂在说什么。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_65f77bcc:



    voice "2SA_0606"
    sachiko "「喂喂，好好遵守设定啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_f0d78556:



    voice "2FU_0643"
    fumi "「咦，寿司卷不用切吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_7654ab0f:


    "祥子阻止了打算把桌上的寿司卷带进厨房的文。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_2c40af57:



    voice "2SA_0607"
    sachiko "「嗯，这是惠方卷，要整个咬下去哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_af225f5b:



    voice "2FU_0644"
    fumi "「惠方卷吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_acb9c907:



    voice "2RI_0795"
    rin "「节分的晚上，对着惠方一边许愿一边吃，不说话吃完的话愿望就会实现，有这样的迷信」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_f4783457:



    voice "2HI_0787"
    hina "「惠方是什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_369b3c03:



    voice "2SA_0608"
    sachiko "「风水好的方向。每年都会变，今年是东北偏东」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_c9ff17d7:



    voice "2MI_0709"
    miyako "「听起来很有意思呢，来做吧来做吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_139925d9:



    voice "2HI_0788"
    hina "「要许什么愿望呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_2d58081f:



    voice "2RI_0796"
    rin "「惠方卷什么的和情人节的巧克力一样，是业界计划好的宣传哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_601dbe4e:



    voice "2SA_0609"
    sachiko "「不要说这种不解风情的话，伦也一起来嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_48eb66d2:



    voice "2RI_0797"
    rin "「我不要。一整个吃下去太辛苦了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_19c97a58:



    voice "2FU_0645"
    fumi "「要我把伦的份切一下吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_4b8dd3d5:



    voice "2FU_0646"
    fumi "「要我把绪方同学的份切一下吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_05665cec:


    "又是像这样纵容。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_68c4b0e6:



    voice "2SA_0610"
    sachiko "「这样吧伦，来玩个游戏吧。比比谁能不说话吃到最后。胜者明年的节分不用做鬼」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_7c09c3b3:



    voice "2RI_0798"
    rin "「哼，还以为你想说什么。真是无聊的游戏呢……来吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_635b793e:



    voice "2FU_0647"
    fumi "「……哈啊。那么我去泡一下茶哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_bfddb536:


    hina_rin_fumi_miyako_sachiko "「我开动了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_44809850:


    "五人朝着惠方一起把寿司卷塞进了嘴里。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_a_f27954df:



    voice "2MI_0711"
    miyako "「好吃！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_a_e893e1c9:


    "刚吃第一口。完全没有理解规则的家伙做出了最棒的反应。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_a_12a3c8c2:


    "连自己被淘汰了都不知道，挂着天真的笑脸一口一口的吃着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_a_ccf99851:



    voice "2MI_0712"
    miyako "「在裹成筒的米中间无数不同的口感交汇，不仅是舌头，连牙齿都感觉到了美味！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_a_ddfcc602:


    "连感想都十分完美。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_047d237c:



    voice "2HI_0790"
    hina "「咳咳咳咳！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_9b29081b:


    "不知道是不是把嘴一次性张的太大了，阳菜呛到了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_153a09dd:



    voice "2FU_0649"
    fumi "「快喝茶——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_1f9c6c82:



    voice "2HI_0791"
    hina "「抱歉——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_d37be9fe:


    "等察觉到的时候已经晚了。想要把茶杯递给阳菜的文和想要接住的阳菜，两人都发出了声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_15ecf657:


    hina_fumi "「……唉」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_44d37fe9:


    "两人垂着肩膀叹气。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_2fbdb855:



    voice "2HI_0793"
    hina "「抱歉啊，把你也卷进来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_5859f5ab:



    voice "2FU_0651"
    fumi "「没事，本来最先出声的就是我。接下来就慢慢吃吧。来，喝茶」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_3d42b670:



    voice "2HI_0794"
    hina "「嗯，谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_3aa9171e:


    "很好地表现了阳菜和文两人的温柔。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_abc6bbcb:



    voice "2RI_0800"
    rin "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_514b06a2:



    voice "2SA_0612"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_e649364a:


    "另一方面，狡猾的两人死死的瞪着对方冷笑着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_55f78f36:


    "然后像是给对方下马威似的狠狠地咬了下去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_b4cebbf1:


    "那么，不择手段的一口气吃惠方卷大战最终的胜者是——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_9318777f:



    voice "2RI_0801"
    rin "「……啊呜呜」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_77e4fd57:


    hina_fumi "「诶！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_46b7a906:


    "胜负因伦突然发出的丢人声音而决出了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_1f068b4e:



    voice "2FU_0653"
    fumi "「那个，怎么了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_c2121e58:



    voice "2RI_0802"
    rin "「这里面加了香菇～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_89aff205:



    voice "2HI_0796"
    hina "「啊，你不爱吃来着？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_4445ad42:



    voice "2RI_0803"
    rin "「最～讨～厌～了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_c615c1d2:



    voice "2FU_0654"
    fumi "「要把香菇去掉接着吃吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_3832316b:



    voice "2RI_0804"
    rin "「嗯……拜托了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_78f190ab:



    voice "2SA_0613"
    sachiko "「太棒啦—赢啦～！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_2fe42a8b:


    "并没有。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_2a9ddbc3:



    voice "2HI_0797"
    hina "「明明还没有吃完就已经说话了哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_b_afea41b3:



    voice "2SA_0614"
    sachiko "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_c_af6571b6:



    voice "2MI_0713"
    miyako "「我吃饱了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_c_77c0d136:


    hina_rin_fumi_sachiko "「啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_c_7a4802d4:


    "圣夜子不知不觉间独自把惠方卷吃完了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_c_5acbd43b:



    voice "2MI_0714"
    miyako "「真好吃♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_09_c_23b23f25:


    "——愿望，要是能实现就好了呢。"
